  "content": "[Intro]\n[Cm]  [Eb]  [Dsus4]\n[Fsus2]\n[Eb]\n[Cm]  [Eb]  [Dsus4]\n[Fsus2]\n[Eb]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Eb][Cm]Before all [Dsus4]things re-\n[Fsus2]born again\n[Eb]\n[Cm]You [Eb]learn the [Dsus4]painful\n[Fsus2]breath of time\n[Eb]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Cm]Cold [Eb]morning [Dsus4]stretches\n[Fsus2]out your arms\n[Eb]\n[Cm]To the [Eb]mighty [Dsus4]warmth of\n[Fsus2]one golden\n[Eb]sun\n\n[Bridge]\n[F]Seems\nall have\n[Gm]gone insane\nfor gold\n[Eb]\n[D]\n[Dsus4]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Cm]All [Eb]was crea-\n[D]ted\n[Cm]out [Eb]of the night\n[D]\n[Cm]We're [Eb]all born\n[D]from the\n[Cm]burst [Eb]of a star\n[D]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]The day you'll\ncome to life you'll\n[Db]realize\n[Cm]Expanding\nforce of life where\n[Db]you belong\n[Gm]\n[Cm]And in the\nwinter cold, with\n[Db]opened eyes\n[Cm]You'll find the\nstrength to fight and\n[Db]stand upright\n[Gm]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Cm]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]One day you'll\nwalk the world and\n[Db]keep in mind\n[Cm]The heart you've\nbeen given in\n[Db]winter time\n[Gm]\n[Cm]And through the\nbitter cold, with\n[Db]opened eyes\n[Cm]You'll find the\nstrength to fight and\n[Db]stand upright\n[Gm]\n\n[Outro]\n[Cm]  [Eb]  [Dsus4]\n[Fsus2]\n[Eb]\n[Cm]  [Eb]  [Dsus4]\n[Fsus2]\n[Eb]\n[D]",
